EVMLean

This repository is based on NethermindEth/EVMYulLean:
https://github.com/NethermindEth/EVMYulLean

The upstream project is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

This copy has been modified to ease proof development over the EVM model.
Notable changes include porting the project to a newer version of Lean,
removing the Yul model and generic EVM/Yul layer, adapting recursion and gas
representation for proof development, and adding an EVM proof library. See
nethermind-changes.md for a conceptual summary.

